    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/6/6/66259.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 35,
    "turn_text": "Senator Ted Cruz, Jr. Senator for the Great State of Texas, I hashtag you, energize your bunny the other night. And I hope it got to you because that's exactly what I saw. I didn't see Can we do this and grab the attention of people? I mean, you didn't have to go to the Apollo Theater in Sing Al Green. You didn't have to go out and yell yes we can. You actually grabbed Republican slash conservative and even some right-leaning Democrats' ears and faces and said, give me a couple of minutes, watch what I'm doing. and realize that there really is a chance to minimize the adverse effect of central government. That's what I walked away from. It wasn't only about Obamacare by the end of it. It was about who has the power in this country and we need to let the people know that they do.",
