    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/6/6/66259.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 36,
    "turn_text": "Right. Now that's exactly right, Joe, and that was the most important thing I was trying to focus attention on, is the divide between Washington and the American people and the dysfunction right now that so many elected officials in Washington aren't listening to the people. They're not listening to the people who are our bosses. And it was my hope that the more engaged I'm convinced, the more engaged the American people get, the more we speak out, that together the American people can make our elected officials listen to the people.",
